pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:60:```````````````````````````````` example_wikilinks
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:69:Wikilinks can have different display text through a utility called piping:
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:71:```````````````````````````````` example_wikilinks
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:72:This is [[WikiLink|a pothole]].
