pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:104:With nested wikilinks, the deepest one takes precedence:
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:106:```````````````````````````````` example_wikilinks
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:107:[[WikiLink|[[Fish]]]]
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:109:<p>[[WikiLink|<a href="Fish">Fish</a>]]</p>
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:112:Links inside wikilinks will take precedence:
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:114:```````````````````````````````` example_wikilinks
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:115:[[WikiLink|[cat](cat.html)]]
pulldown-cmark/specs/wikilinks.txt:117:<p>[[WikiLink|<a href="cat.html">cat</a>]]</p>
